#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/selection_properties.rst:5
msgid "Selection properties panel"
msgstr "选择属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/selection_properties.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Selection properties panel displays the appearance and geometry "
"properties from the selected `part`_ (`line`_, `terminal`_, `rectangle`_, "
"`dynamic text`_, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"选择属性面板显示所选 `部件 <part_>`_ (`线条 <line_>`_，`端子 <terminal_>`_，`矩形 "
"<rectangle_>`_，`动态文本 <dynamic text_>`_ 等的外观和几何属性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/selection_properties.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Selection properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器选择属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/selection_properties.rst:15
msgid "To display the Selection properties panel:"
msgstr "要显示选择属性面板："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/panels/selection_properties.rst:17
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Selection properties** menu item to display "
"the Selection properties panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 菜单项以显示选择属性面板。"
